[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 241.47, "timestamp": "00:04:01", "text": "似乎沒有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 244.869, "timestamp": "00:04:04", "text": "。希望你們一切都好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.39, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "。我會再做一次。我再說一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 247.71, "timestamp": "00:04:07", "text": "。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 256.069, "timestamp": "00:04:16", "text": "你們最近怎麼樣？是的。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.629, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "一切都好。所以，你們今天過得怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 265.99, "timestamp": "00:04:25", "text": "對我來說，這是美好的一天。我大概是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 271.95, "timestamp": "00:04:31", "text": "醒了。我醒了之類的。我做了些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.51, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "事，走了一小段路，然後我們就到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 277.83, "timestamp": "00:04:37", "text": "這裡。然後我就想，「哦不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 280.95, "timestamp": "00:04:40", "text": "有直播。」我當時就想，「哦，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 295.15, "timestamp": "00:04:55", "text": "[音樂]串流的顯示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 299.629, "timestamp": "00:04:59", "text": "，更多更多。嗯，"}]